{"words": [{"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "زَلَلْتُم", "translation": "you slip"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْكُمُ", "translation": "came to you"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ", "translation": "(from) the clear proofs"}, {"text": "فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "then know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَزِيزٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Mighty"}, {"text": "حَكِيمٌ", "translation": "All-Wise"}], "sahih": "But if you slip [i.e., deviate] after clear proofs have come to you, then know that Allāh is Exalted in Might and Wise."}